("food","hard","A guest wants a cheaper bite and drinks at Benihana after a meeting on a weekday. What do you suggest?","Un huésped quiere algo más barato y bebidas en Benihana después de una junta entre semana. ¿Qué le sugieres?",["Happy hour in the bar and lounge, Mon–Fri 3–6 p.m.","Brunch on Sunday at 8 a.m.","Late-night menu after midnight","There are no specials"],["El happy hour en el bar, de lunes a viernes de 3 a 6 p. m.","El brunch del domingo a las 8 a. m.","El menú de medianoche","No hay promociones"],"Benihana lists happy hour Monday–Friday 3–6 p.m. in the bar and lounge.","Benihana tiene happy hour de lunes a viernes de 3 a 6 p. m. en el bar.",BEN),
