("liquor","med","A guest wants to buy a bottle of wine on Sunday afternoon. What are Liquor Barrel's Sunday hours?","Un huésped quiere comprar una botella de vino el domingo en la tarde. ¿Qué horario tiene Liquor Barrel el domingo?",["11 a.m. to 6 p.m.","9 a.m. to 10 p.m.","Closed all day","Noon to midnight"],["De 11 a. m. a 6 p. m.","De 9 a. m. a 10 p. m.","Cierra todo el día","Del mediodía a la medianoche"],"Liquor Barrel (7890 Olson Memorial Hwy) is open Sunday 11–6, matching Minnesota's Sunday off-sale hours.","Liquor Barrel (7890 Olson Memorial Hwy) abre el domingo de 11 a 6, como lo permite la ley de Minnesota.",LB),
